5_set_overview.png", "id": "1471322258472762", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839680_1471322261806095_8547781517118585586_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IbB-0IRnNAUQ7kNvwH36oPN&_nc_oc=AdprX33PeBxfTwt_4iFe-NxRkL8x3uxFDoOWhk_fRt3iKjaO2Fou9hNlz6FFhHWG9cw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQThyeG6S04d8WH43zVwHJ0FnDnY_nf8EljrBGQWEWb9Ag&oe=6B0DC40C"}, {"file_name": "03_poke_thermo.png", "id": "1615380090272080", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839682_1615380093605413_4428879284229094061_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8wbTRboPmVUQ7kNvwGGxJso&_nc_oc=AdrUUugMK4DFcw4mAgHW2A9e4Iqjmx-PPA68L26UV5VEyrGe96Tx7Bzk84EfOwCh5vc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTyq2y-mpHnjY4LxCtc8cuWyGysHmmPLj0Rc_ujvfU3Fg&oe=6B0DC071"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Mochi Manju", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Lift the lid of the bamboo steamer, and there it is: one soft, fluffy manju.\n\nMochi Manju is a mixed reality squeeze toy for Meta Quest 3 / 3S. Using passthrough, a steamer basket and a manju (a Japanese steamed bun) appear right on the table in your room.\n\n\u25a0 Squishy, in your own hands\nPoke it and it dents. Squeeze it and it squashes. Pull with both hands and it stretches, then wobbles back into shape. Play with hand tracking or controllers.\n\n\u25a0 On your real table\nYour room scan lets thounce off it and rollonto the floor. Hold the basket, lift the lid and take the manju out.\n\n\u25a0 26 kinds of manju\nTraditional wagashi colours like plain, sakura, yomogi, chestnut and matcha \u2014 and every now and then, something unusual: sparkling, jelly, mirror metal, magma, hologram\u2026 Shiny ones even reflect your room.\n\n\u25a0 Ring the bell to reset\nRing the counter bell once for a fresh manju, twice to place the set\nsomewhere else.\n\nNo game over, no scorelike.\n\nRequirements:\n- Meta Quest 3 or Quest 3S\n- Space Setup (scanning your table makes it best)\n- Headset camera permioom in reflections.Images are never stored or sent)", "short_description": "A soft, squishy manju appears right on your real table. Grab it, squeeze it, stretch it \u2014 a mixed reality squeeze toy you play with your own hands."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MochiManju_Square_1440x1440.png", "id": "1835889600763428", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839693_1835889604096761_4927538664589106423_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Io9kIi3h2QUQ7kNvwFlIJoL&_nc_oc=AdrlzrbDk510LlhEJdiPFFiCnhFyjYS6w-YKQWLVqSTHSO6STWvxAqc9msbLnwoUyXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSDP8H08TLwzS7MIAMv7ONLEE8vaNwX_Zh3kvoizAvLgw&oe=6B0DB832"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "1813967526502383", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839675_1813967529835716_5448810148686425471_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rjnwVZfoWBMQ7kNvwFQYuTH&_nc_oc=AdpGg_1EnHaFPQEciEM-zfMnX_ut00UwVZaQJydnyG8d4_AgIvlXxEAbIUYamwMiXes&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRc8cu81X-MQpIJvz0Mpnv3LPDWGjCPPkkyXpSGxcrAwg&oe=6B0D9B77"}, {"file_name": "MochiManju_Hero_3000x900.png", "id": "1463077856002018", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839661_1463077859335351_189402460177348572_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LKyNWwuUCsUQ7kNvwE-9WYs&_nc_oc=Adp-he-55xXPi0-5SKDtTc52zqgLvIvf9DyIz5tVMl50PUC2ILRVxqom9wxuqKDl-vY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTYH0QsfWUywNxlaZuDGhGK_56kdon0dL350YmgWXKKoA&oe=6B0DB3FF"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.